# NOTE on /android and /ios:
# We commit the native folders (non-CNG mode) so EAS Build can find
# gradlew + xcodeproj. EAS treats .easignore as ADDITIVE to .gitignore
# (not a replacement), so a /android rule here would still strip the
# native folders during upload — even with .easignore present. Leave
# them un-ignored. If `expo prebuild --clean` regenerates them locally,
# either commit the regen or `git checkout android ios` to revert.
facil-release.keystore
